  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup heavy cream (chilled well)",
    "1 tablespoon erythritol (powdered)",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Powder the erythritol using a spice grinder or small blender. Set aside with the rest of the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-whipped-cream/#wprm-recipe-53373-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/Keto-whipped-cream-sugar-free-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour cold heavy cream into a large, dry mixing bowl. If washed prior, make sure that all water is wiped from the mixing bowl as just a small amount of water can ruin whipped cream.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-whipped-cream/#wprm-recipe-53373-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/Keto-whipped-cream-sugar-free-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start slowly mixing the cream together using a hand mixer. Increase the speed as the cream thickens to not splash the cream.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-whipped-cream/#wprm-recipe-53373-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/Keto-whipped-cream-sugar-free-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "After about 60 seconds of whipping, add the powdered erythritol and vanilla extract.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-whipped-cream/#wprm-recipe-53373-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/Keto-whipped-cream-sugar-free-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue whipping until medium peaks form. The peaks should be noticeable on your beaters when lifted out of the cream.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-whipped-cream/#wprm-recipe-53373-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/Keto-whipped-cream-sugar-free-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the cream to a serving bowl to serve with the dish of your choice. You can save in an airtight container for 2-3 days in the fridge.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-whipped-cream/#wprm-recipe-53373-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
